{#- The other posts, chosen by the build rather than by hand, so writing a
    fifth article links it from the other four without touching them. A list
    rather than cards: the cards here were the blog index's cards repeated,
    which made every post end in a copy of the page it came from. -#}
<section class="band band--sand">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>More from Reem's blog</h2>
    <ul class="link-list">
      {%- for post in collections.pages | childrenOf("/blog/") %}
      {%- if post.url != page.url %}
      <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.nav }}</a></li>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
      <li><a href="/blog/">Every post</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
